rers, provided voltage ratings and tolerances match. Engineers often cross-reference equivalent parts using the datasheet to ensure electrical and mechanical compatibility. Always verify specifications when selecting substitutes for critical applications."},{"question":"What Reliability Standards and Certifications Does the CL05B103KB5NNNC Meet?","answer":"The CL05B103KB5NNNC is RoHS compliant, as confirmed on the LCSC product page. Samsung Electro-Mechanics components are manufactured to meet high industry reliability standards. The X7R dielectric ensures stable capacitance over temperature variations, enhancing long-term reliability."}],"pdfUrl":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/02336ea48ea44ca18c72517dd3cb7b47.pdf?productCode=C15195","authenticationList":["ROHS3 认证"],"isRohsCert":true,"rohsCertType":"ROHS3","rohsCertList":[{"fileCode":"wj1864931","fileName":" 贴片电容(MLCC)_ROHS认证_SAMSUNG(三星).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fe72c154ab3703f908ae5b1ac157c1ec.zip"},{"fileCode":"wj1624669","fileName":"ROHS认证_贴片电容原材料_SAMSUNG(三星).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/329ecc8904689d9af5b272ec0ed8e00a.zip"},{"fileCode":"wj1750838","fileName":"全量通用_ROHS认证_SAMSUNG(三星半导体).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fe7ad62d96832adf9770d718059cff38.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1478399","fileName":"MLCCCL系列_ROHS认证(英文版)_SAMSUNG(三星).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/5b97a5d84519001adb216d4c9e6919ce.pdf"}],"productDescEn":"10nF ±10% 50V Ceramic Capacitor X7R 0402","productIntroEn":"10nF ±10% 50V Ceramic Capacitor X7R 0402","paramVOList":[{"paramCode":"param_10951_n","paramName":"容值","paramNameEn":"Capacitance","paramValue":"10nF","paramValueEn":"10nF","paramValueEnForSearch":10000.0,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":1},{"paramCode":"param_10927","paramName":"温度系数","paramNameEn":"Temperature Coefficient","paramValue":"X7R","paramValueEn":"X7R","paramValueEnForSearch":-1.0,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":